						<span class="live"><span class="live-dot"></span>Verfügbar für Projekte</span>
						<span class="photo-meta">Alexander Ohl · Gründer, Pragma-Code</span>
						<span class="photo-meta">DACH · Remote</span>
					</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</div>
