						<a class="card-cta" href="https://www.pragma-code.de/webentwicklung" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Zur Leistung bei Pragma-Code <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
					</article>
					<article class="card reveal">
						<div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="M20 20l-4.7-4.7"/><path d="M7.6 11.4l1.9-1.9 1.5 1.5 2.6-2.6"/></svg></div>
